    "body": "Proves k303,b: signed product of the OUTER tangent-polygon area and actual center-perpendicular-foot area on its boundary tangent side lines, for strict confocal elliptical caustics and periods not divisible by four, admitted coprime stars/reversal/fixed repeats. All 23 original artifacts and author turn 1/5 preserved.\n\nThe fixed-linear edge-vector map, signed-area traces and classical odd Jacobi identity give the full proof and invariant value. KLS2002/KS2003-2004/AST-BT2020/Stachel/Jacobi/conic and established meromorphic methods credited. A. Ferudun 2026 v1.1 Theorem 2/Section 6 is the exact contemporary full theorem; v1.0 primitive-even subset distinguished. Historical ordering, non-derivation and novelty undetermined; no first/exclusive/new-identity/current-worldwide-open claim.\n\nBounded source/priority reproduction, required NEW sequential whole-package and helper-source reviews and all required repairs completed. Exact controls and labelled uncertified diagnostics accompany the note. Extensive AI use; unrefereed, no independent human peer review or formal verification.\n\nVerified preprint/source archive: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23413614. One GWS append/all four cells verified 'Math Puzzles'!A121:D121.",
